<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aukland in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Aukland in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aukland Investments Ltd cautioned on Wednesday that it was involved in negotiations which could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in dealing in shares until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
